This implementation of the use_mpi module file is drawn from the MPICH
implementation in MPI 3.4.2, Copyright Argonne National Laboratory.

Values in the source files are valid for a particular system but should not
be used for any MPI implementation - please see the MPICH implemenation (or
any other standard-conforming implementation of MPI) for a Fortran
support for an MPI implementation.  These are provided only to provide
checking of Fortran examples in the MPI standard that use the mpi_f08
module.

As the MPI standard is changed and extended, these files will be modified
and will diverge from the MPICH 3.4.2 version.
